  "releaseNotes": "This version based on commit https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/commit/1a4e1a72f95db0f3a763c799d156bbc44120c7b0\n\nAdd `Material.Avalonia.TreeDataGrid` project with TreeDataGrid styles (#467)\n\n* Add `Material.Avalonia.TreeDataGrid` project with TreeDataGrid styles and functionality.\n\n* Fix: Added fixed width to `PART_ExpanderPanel` to prevent toggle button (chevron) visibility changes from misaligning content.\n\n* Refactor: Split `TreeDataGrid` styles into separate axaml files for better organization and maintainability.\n\n* Add TreeDataGridStyles auto importing\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nikita Manchuk <n.manchuk@okbsapr.ru>\nCo-authored-by: SKProCH <skproch@yandex.ru>",
